                "title": "8 Inch Modern Surface Bolt, Deltana 8SBM",
                "description": "DEL-8SBM Deltana 8 Inch Modern Surface Bolt - The 8 inch modern door bolts made of heavy duty solid brass and is available in 8 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 8 inch modern surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.",
